# Root build-context allowlist for the bird system agent image.
# Everything is excluded by default; only the entries below enter the image
# layer. No data/, no _upstream/, no tests/, no evaluator-only content —
# enforced structurally here and by tests/contract/test_bird_gt_isolation.py.
**
!src
!src/**
!configs
!configs/model
!configs/model/**
!bird_system_agent
!bird_system_agent/**
!pyproject.toml
!.cache
!.cache/commerce-agent
!.cache/commerce-agent/deepseek-tokenizer
!.cache/commerce-agent/deepseek-tokenizer/**
